// Auto-generated benchmark corpus (single file, one `main`).
// Sections, in order:
//   1. Arithmetic / float / boolean / string helper functions
//      plus trivial no-op functions.
//   2. Control-flow heavy: recursion, while/for loops, nested
//      if/else-if chains, classic numeric algorithms.
//   3. Deep expression nesting: long chained-arithmetic/boolean
//      functions, more trivial padding.
//   4. HTTP-endpoint-heavy scene construction: camera/background/
//      image/output PUT/PATCH plus a large unrolled batch of
//      POST /hittable Sphere{...} across all material variants.
// `main()` at the bottom exercises a slice of every section above.

